  "notes": "COMMON COLLOCATIONS:\n- {交付|こうふ}する (to issue, to grant)\n- {交付|こうふ}を{受|う}ける (to receive an issuance)\n- {交付|こうふ}{金|きん} (grant money, subsidy)\n- {交付|こうふ}{日|び} (date of issuance)\n- {交付|こうふ}を{申請|しんせい}する (to apply for issuance)\n\nREGISTER: {交付|こうふ} is a formal, administrative term. It is used specifically for official documents and funds distributed by government or institutional authorities.",
